abstract: "Code, firmware and data for detecting falsified telemetry in traffic digital twins: a hybrid detector evaluated under adaptive attack on real trajectories, a microsimulation and the VeReMi Extension benchmark, a bench hardware prototype, and post-quantum cryptography costs on 8-bit and ESP32 microcontrollers."
